[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d11_occupancy_notice"
title = "Notice of suspended civil-defense use"
byline = "typed, taped over the licensed-capacity sign at the shelter door"
hand = 0
body = "NOTICE

Effective 01 SEP 1964 the fallout shelter
capacity posted at this entrance is suspended
and shall not be relied upon.

This facility is assigned to Office of Civil
Defense Task Order 4-A, Shelter Habitability
Research Program, for the period of the task
order and any extension thereof.

Occupancy during a research run is limited to
persons named on the current run schedule.

The posted capacity of 140 persons does not
apply and the shelter is not to be entered by
the public under any circumstance.

Queries to the Field Station office.

                              M. KETCH
                              Principal Investigator
                              Ridgewater Field Station

Please leave the original sign in place beneath
this notice."
